#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:160
msgid "参数自动解析"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:162
msgid "执行参数自动解析前首先会获取`kernel`函数调用时未传入的参数，**将未传入的参数作为切分轴和分块轴参数的候选项**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:164
msgid "@triton.jit\n"
"def kernel_func(\n"
"    outputptr,\n"
"    input_ptr,\n"
"    n_rows,\n"
"    n_cols,\n"
"    BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr,\n"
"    XBLOCK: tl.constexpr,\n"
"    XBLOCK_SUB: tl.constexpr,\n"
"):\n"
"    # kernel implementation\n"
"    ...\n"
"\n"
"# XBLOCK and XBLOCK_SUB are not passed, so they are candidates for split axis and tiling axis parameters\n"
"# BLOCK_SIZE is passed as a keyword argument, so it is not a parameter candidate and will not be recognized\n"
"kernel_func[grid](y, x, n_rows, n_cols, BLOCK_SIZE=block_size)\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:183
msgid "切分轴参数解析"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:185
msgid "切分轴参数解析依据 `tl.program_id()`分核语句来确定 ，系统通过分析程序中 `tl.program_id()` 变量的使用情况及其与其他变量的乘法运算识别潜在的切分轴参数（当前支持直接相乘或通过中间变量间接相乘的场景），并根据候选参数列表（用户未提供的参数）进行过滤。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:187
msgid "最后通过掩码比较和 `autotune` 中传入的 `key` 确认当前参数对应的切分轴。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:189
msgid "注意：1. 分割轴参数必须要与 `tl.program_id()` 相乘。 2. 必须要进行掩码比较，且该轴对应的key需要直接作为右值或以key为参数的min函数作为右值，才能对应到具体的切分轴，否则会导致参数解析失败。3. 识别出的分割轴参数仅限于候选参数列表，确保只有那些可以通过自动调优动态调整的参数才会被考虑。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:191
msgid "@triton.autotune(\n"
"    configs=[],\n"
"    key={\"n_elements\"} # Must be specified\n"
"    ...\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def triton_func(...):\n"
"    # case1:\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n"
"    block_start = pid * XBLOCK\n"
"    offsets = block_start + tl.arange(0, XBLOCK)\n"
"\n"
"    # case2:\n"
"    block_start = tl.program_id(0) * XBLOCK\n"
"    offsets = block_start + tl.arange(0, XBLOCK)\n"
"\n"
"    # case3:\n"
"    offsets = tl.program_id(0) * XBLOCK + tl.arange(0, XBLOCK)\n"
"\n"
"    # mask compare\n"
"    mask = offsets < n_elements # 1\n"
"    mask = offsets < min(..., n_elements) # 2\n"
"\n"
"# The split axis parameter is resolved as split_params = {\"x\": \"XBLOCK\"}\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:218
msgid "分块轴参数解析"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:220
msgid "分块轴参数依据 `tl.arange()` ，`tl.range()`，`range()` 分块语句来确定。通过分析程序中`for` 循环里的 `tl.range()`，`tl.arange()`以及`range()` 的使用情况及其计算得到的变量来识别潜在的分块轴参数，提取 `tl.range()` 或 `range()` 中和 `tl.arange()` 的共同参数，并根据候选参数列表（用户未提供的参数）进行过滤。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:222
msgid "最后通过掩码比较和 `autotune` 中传入的 `key` 确认当前参数对应的分块轴。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:224
msgid "注意：1. 分块轴参数必须出现在 `tl.arange()` 的调用中，并且需在 `for` 循环中通过 `tl.range()`、`range()` 或整除运算（`//`）参与循环范围的计算。 2. 必须要进行掩码比较，且该轴对应的key需要直接作为右值或以key为参数的min函数作为右值，才能对应到具体的分块轴，否则会导致参数解析失败。3. 识别出的分块轴参数仅限于候选参数列表，确保只有那些可以通过自动调优动态调整的参数才会被考虑。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:226
msgid "@triton.autotune(\n"
"    key={\"n_rows\", \"n_cols\"} # Must be specified\n"
"    ...\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def triton_func(...):\n"
"    ...\n"
"    # case 1\n"
"    for row_idx in tl.range(0, XBLOCK, XBLOCK_SUB):\n"
"        row_offsets = row_idx + tl.arange(0, XBLOCK_SUB)[:, None]\n"
"        col_offsets = tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)[None, :]\n"
"\n"
"    # case 2\n"
"    loops = (XBLOCK + XBLOCK_SUB - 1) // XBLOCK_SUB\n"
"    for loop in range(loops):\n"
"        row_offsets = loop * XBLOCK_SUB + tl.arange(0, XBLOCK_SUB)[:, None]\n"
"        col_offsets = tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)[None, :]\n"
"\n"
"        ...\n"
"        xmask = row_offsets < n_rows # 1\n"
"        xmask = row_offsets < min(..., n_rows) # 2\n"
"        ymask = col_offsets < n_cols\n"
"\n"
"# The tiling axis parameter is resolved as tiling_params = {\"x\": \"XBLOCK_SUB\"}\n"
"# Although BLOCK_SIZE is also used in tl.arange and compared with n_cols to compute the mask, it is not a tiling axis parameter\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:254
msgid "低维轴参数解析"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:256
msgid "低维轴参数解析依据 `tl.arange()` 分块语句来确定，通过分析程序中 `tl.arange()` 的使用情况及其计算得到的变量来识别潜在的低维轴参数，提取 `tl.arange()` 本身以及它参与计算的变量，通过是否进行切片操作来进行增维，以及通过判断增维维度来进行过滤。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:258
msgid "最后通过掩码比较和 `autotune` 中传入的 `key` 确认当前kernel的低维轴。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:260
msgid "注意：1. 低维轴必须要通过`tl.arange()`进行计算，并进行切片。并在非最低维进行维度扩充或不参与切片，才会被识别。 2. 若不进行掩码比较则无法对应到具体的低维轴，会导致参数解析失败。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:262
msgid "@triton.autotune(\n"
"    key={\"n_rows\", \"n_cols\"} # Will be automatically assigned in order as {\"x\": \"n_rows\", \"y\": \"n_cols\"}\n"
"    ...\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def triton_func(...):\n"
"    ...\n"
"    for row_idx in tl.range(0, XBLOCK, XBLOCK_SUB):\n"
"        row_offsets = row_idx + tl.arange(0, XBLOCK_SUB)[:, None]\n"
"        col_offsets = tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)[None, :]\n"
"\n"
"        xmask = row_offsets < n_rows\n"
"        ymask = col_offsets < n_cols\n"
"\n"
"# The low-dimension axis is resolved as low_dim_axes = {\"y\"}\n"
"# Although row_offsets is also computed via tl.arange and compared with n_rows to compute the mask, the slicing expands along the low dimension, so x is not a low-dimension axis\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:281
msgid "参数指针解析"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:283
msgid "指针类型的参数解析依据该参数是否参与 `tl.load()` 和 `tl.store()` 的访存类语句来确定。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:285
msgid "首先解析出kernel函数中的所有参数，之后递归寻找每一个参数参与计算的所有变量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:287
msgid "如果该参数直接参与或该参数计算得到的中间变量间接参与 `tl.load()` 和 `tl.store()` 的第一个参数计算，则认为该参数是一个指针类型参数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:289
msgid "注意：1. 使用 `tl.constexpr` 修饰的变量不会是指针类型的变量，不进行后续解析 2. 只计算参数直接参与或参数经过一次计算得到的中间变量间接参与的访存类语句，若参数进行两次以上计算得到的中间变量不进行统计。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/examples/06_autotune_example.md:291
msgid "@triton.autotune(...)\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def triton_func(input_ptr, output_ptr, ...):\n"
"    ...\n"
"    # case1\n"
"    input = tl.load(input_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    tl.store(output_ptr + offsets, input, mask=mask)\n"
"\n"
"    # case2\n"
"    inputs_ptr = input_ptr + offsets\n"
"    input = tl.load(inputs_ptr, mask=mask)\n"
"    outputs_ptr = output_ptr + offsets\n"
"    tl.store(outputs_ptr, input, mask=mask)\n"
"\n"
"# The pointer type parameters are resolved as: input_ptr, output_ptr\n"
""
msgstr ""

